{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "159", "x": 0.8951488575183035, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03859439108533224, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yes, tell them about that. And are there any physical", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8262043375642306, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "difficulties you have caring for her? Lifting her, for example.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.14855893341404705, "w": 0.6190037127361522, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Yes, she's quite heavy and I'm afraid of hurting my", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17407104281091368, "w": 0.826189368920975, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "back. I'd be in real trouble if that happened.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19958322765056533, "w": 0.4508420271931036, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): They can give you advice about that and also about how to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22509541249021695, "w": 0.8260853060928632, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "avoid the possibility of your mom having a fall.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2506075973298686, "w": 0.478457431075293, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Great. So, once they've done this assessment, if I'm", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2761568245769659, "w": 0.8262464753202444, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "eligible, what happens next?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.30166900941661756, "w": 0.30144338218339806, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Well, they might support you financially. So, they might help", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32703277943743525, "w": 0.8263479750245112, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "you with transport costs, like if you have to get a taxi to take your mother for an", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.35254496427708687, "w": 0.8260552662813984, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "appointment, for example.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.2778594389034833, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): I usually drive her myself, actually. So, could I claim for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40356933395639016, "w": 0.8263432588766362, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "the petrol?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4290814810746493, "w": 0.12219526328561925, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): You could. And you can claim for the insurance, too.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4545936659143009, "w": 0.7371250700886215, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Oh, right.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.479982200029302, "w": 0.37804085168299323, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): And if you need help with the housework, they can arrange", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5054943848689536, "w": 0.826290253475519, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "for someone to come along once or twice a week. And one other thing, I hope You", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5310065319872127, "w": 0.8262296612278204, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "don't mind me saying this, but it's important you look after yourself. And it seems", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5565187168268644, "w": 0.8261640452573853, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to me you're under quite a bit of stress.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5820308639451235, "w": 0.40689931936758916, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): I am. Yes.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6075430487847752, "w": 0.3796534666813893, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Well, tell the council because they may be able to give you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.8260467567102326, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "some advice on how to minimize it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6584190602273332, "w": 0.3588914971237137, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman Carer): Really, though, actually, I feel so much better having", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6839682874744305, "w": 0.8263996476012287, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "talked to you. I'll get in touch with the council straight away. Now, shall we go for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7094804723140822, "w": 0.8262872802518587, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "coffee or.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7349926571537339, "w": 0.10788362556533541, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}